  "prefLabel": "Tra 101.06 Petition",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tra 101.06 \"Petition\" means a written expression of concern in which a person requests the adoption, amendment, repeal of a rule, or requests a declaratory ruling.\n\nSource. #4595, eff 4-6-89; ss by #5605, eff 3-29-93",
